 "category_en": "Historic site",
 "intro_zh": "嘉兴南湖作为中共一大会址的组成部分而彪炳史册。南湖分为东、西两湖，形似鸳鸯交颈，因此又名鸳鸯湖。景区包含南湖核心区、月河历史街区、七一广场等，是一个集旅游观光、南湖风光休闲娱乐、历史教育为一体的综合性历史文化景区。",
 "intro_en": "Jiaxing (simplified Chinese: 嘉兴; traditional Chinese: 嘉興; pinyin: Jiāxīng; Wade–Giles: Chia-hsing), alternately romanized as Kashing, is a prefecture-level city in northern Zhejiang province, China. Lying on the Grand Canal of China, Jiaxing borders Hangzhou to the southwest, Huzhou to the west, Shanghai to the northeast, and the province of Jiangsu to the north. As of the 2020 census, its population was 5,400,868 and its built-up (or metro) area, made up of 2 urban districts was home to 1,518,654 inhabitants.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
